WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.112
Your Rights as a CFNIS Subject.

00:00:03.062 --> 00:00:20.762
If you are the subject of a CFNIS investigation or have experienced military police misconduct, you can file with the Military Police Complaints Commission, contact the DND Ombudsman, file a civilian criminal complaint, or pursue s.504 private prosecution.

00:00:20.762 --> 00:00:25.825
These avenues exist even without a Military Whistleblower Protection Act.
